# /clickable-paths：显示当前设置
Output "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-yangguandao-Projects-pi-personal-extensions/446cc168-f46d-47aa-9300-0cee8a1ae535/scratchpad/raw/clickable-paths-status.mp4"
# 终端窗口缩小到内容区域，让文字在约 640px 宽的显示框里仍可读
Set Width 960
Set Height 460
Source "docs/extensions-usage/tapes/_settings.tape"

Hide
Type "cd /Users/yangguandao/Projects/pi-personal-extensions && clear && pi "
Enter
Wait+Screen /未命名会话|｜/
